guide thmastin-professions/fishing-cooking-horde
title Fishing and Cooking 1-300 (Horde)
faction Horde
category Professions
coords era
levels 5-60
zone Durotar

# Generated by tools/fishing-cooking.js: edit that script, then run it again.
# Levels Fishing and Cooking together: every fish you catch is cooked, so Cooking
# needs no hunting. Each band picks its water from where you are: the step for the
# zone you stand in (or a nearby one when you are in a city), else a default water.
# Once you reach a listed zone the guide stays with it; flying over another listed
# zone can switch it early (zone text changes in the air).
# Catch rates: the Classic fishing tables (CMaNGOS classic-db) per subzone, else zone;
# tools/fishing-pools.json. Waters under half the best rate of their band are left out.
# ASSUMED: Forever keeps the Classic tables (Darnassus checked in game: few Smallfish).
# Recipes, skill colours, vendors, trainers and quest data: Polestar reference data.

section Cooking 1-300

# ---- Fishing 1-50, Cooking 1-50

step Get a Fishing Pole
  when !skill Fishing 1
  tip You fish with a pole equipped. The arrow picks the nearest seller. Any fishing pole works; if you already have one, skip this step.
  buy 6256 x1 nearest

step Learn Fishing and Cooking
  tip The arrow picks the nearest trainer of each. Equip your Fishing Pole. A Shiny Bauble on the pole (+25 for ten minutes) means fewer fish get away early on.
  train Fishing Apprentice
  train Cooking Apprentice
  buy 6529 x2 nearest optional

step Make Campfire Kits
  when !has 279981 x10
  tip Kits are used up, so carry 10. Every cook on Forever knows Basic Campfire: it crafts a Basic Campfire Kit from one Simple Wood (Flint and Tinder stays in your bags), and placing the kit lights a cooking fire at the water, one every 5 minutes. Buy one Simple Wood for each kit you are short and craft them in your Cooking window; the first ones also raise Cooking to about 5.
  buy 4471 x1 nearest
  buy 4470 x10 nearest optional
  collect 279981 x10 anywhere

step Fishing 1-50: to Durotar
  when zone "Orgrimmar"
  zone Durotar
  tip The nearest good water for this range from Orgrimmar is Durotar: the sea below Sen'jin Village. About 98% of catches there are Raw Slitherskin Mackerel. Any of Mulgore, Tirisfal Glades, Zephras Isle works too: go there instead and the guide follows you.
  learn 7752 nearest
  skill Fishing 50
  collect 6303 x50 anywhere optional
  craft 7752 until 50
  goto 53.25,81.59 "Sen'jin coast" r 25 optional

step Fishing 1-50: to Durotar
