step Fishing 1-50: to Mulgore
  when zone "Thunder Bluff"
  zone Mulgore
  tip The nearest good water for this range from Thunder Bluff is Mulgore: the lake south of Bloodhoof Village. About 59% of catches there are Raw Brilliant Smallfish. Thunder Bluff pools gives only about 18% Raw Brilliant Smallfish, so it is left out. Any of Durotar, Tirisfal Glades, Zephras Isle works too: go there instead and the guide follows you.
  learn 7751 nearest
  skill Fishing 50
  collect 6291 x50 anywhere optional
  craft 7751 until 50
  goto 44.16,63.8 live "Stonebull Lake" r 25 optional

step Fishing 1-50: to Tirisfal Glades
  when zone "Undercity"
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip The nearest good water for this range from Undercity is Tirisfal Glades: the lake east of Brill. Undercity canals gives only about 13% Raw Brilliant Smallfish, so it is left out. Any of Durotar, Mulgore, Zephras Isle works too: go there instead and the guide follows you.
  learn 7751 nearest
  skill Fishing 50
  collect 6291 x50 anywhere optional
