step Fishing 1-50: Durotar
  when zone "Durotar"
  zone Durotar
  tip If you don't know Slitherskin Mackerel yet, the arrow first takes you to its nearest seller. Fish the sea below Sen'jin Village until Fishing 50 and cook what you catch as you go until Cooking 50: about 98% of catches are Raw Slitherskin Mackerel, so cook Slitherskin Mackerel. Place a Basic Campfire Kit beside the water (one every 5 minutes) and empty your bags into the fire; any fish recipe you know counts toward the Cooking target. The Raw Slitherskin Mackerel line counts the fish you still need for Cooking 50 (about 50 from Cooking 1) and drops as your Cooking rises; once your bags hold that many, stop fishing and cook. That is roughly 60 casts here, about 15 minutes.
  learn 7752 nearest
  skill Fishing 50
  collect 6303 x50 anywhere optional
  craft 7752 until 50
  goto 53.25,81.59 "Sen'jin coast" r 25 optional

