# ---- Fishing 150-175, Cooking 150-175

step Expert Fishing and Cooking
  tip Both are books, not trainer ranks, and both lift the cap to 225. Expert Fishing - The Bass and You is sold only by Old Man Heming on the docks of Booty Bay; the Expert Cookbook has its own sellers and the arrow picks the nearest. Buy each and read it. Both need character level 20.
  level 20
  train Fishing Expert
  train Cooking Expert
  buy 6530 x5 nearest optional

