step Fishing 150-175: Stonetalon Mountains
  when zone "Stonetalon Mountains"
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip If you don't know Bristle Whisker Catfish yet, the arrow first takes you to its nearest seller. Fish the lake in the middle of the zone until Fishing 175 and cook what you catch as you go until Cooking 175: about 63% of catches are Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish, so cook Bristle Whisker Catfish. Place a Basic Campfire Kit beside the water (one every 5 minutes) and empty your bags into the fire; any fish recipe you know counts toward the Cooking target. The Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish line counts the fish you still need for Cooking 175 (about 69 from Cooking 150) and drops as your Cooking rises; once your bags hold that many, stop fishing and cook. That is roughly 110 casts here, about 35 minutes.
  learn 7755 nearest
  skill Fishing 175
  collect 6308 x111 anywhere optional
  craft 7755 until 175
  goto 46.9,41.7 "Mirkfallon Lake" r 25 optional

