  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip If you don't know Rockscale Cod yet, the arrow first takes you to its nearest seller. Fish the bay under Booty Bay until Fishing 225 and cook what you catch as you go until Cooking 225: about 55% of catches are Raw Rockscale Cod, so cook Rockscale Cod. Place a Basic Campfire Kit beside the water (one every 5 minutes) and empty your bags into the fire; any fish recipe you know counts toward the Cooking target. The Raw Rockscale Cod line counts the fish you still need for Cooking 225 (about 95 from Cooking 175) and drops as your Cooking rises; once your bags hold that many, stop fishing and cook. That is roughly 180 casts here, about 55 minutes. Away from this coast, Stranglethorn Vale's inland water gives Raw Mithril Head Trout (about 58% of catches), and Cooking 175-225 takes only about 52 of those: learn Mithril Headed Trout and fish there if you know a spot.
  learn 7828 nearest
