# ---- Fishing 225-300, Cooking 225-300

step Artisan: Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Both Artisan ranks come from quests that start with the trainers in Orgrimmar: the fishing trainer sends you to Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh, the cooking trainer to Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan. Both need skill 225 and character level 35. Buy the Alterac Swiss for Dirge while you are in town.
  skill Fishing 225
  skill Cooking 225
  level 35
  accept 6608
  accept 6611
  buy 8932 x20 nearest

step Nat Pagle
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Nat Pagle fishes on a small island off the coast south of Theramore: swim across. He wants four fish, each from its own stretch of water; they only bite while you have his quest.
  turnin 6608
  accept 6607

step Zesty Clam Meat
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip The Muckshell crabs along the shore south-west of Theramore drop Big-mouth Clams; open each one for Zesty Clam Meat. Dirge wants 10.
  collect 7974 x10 @55.4,63.3

step Sar'theris Striker
  zone Desolace
  tip Fish the coast of Desolace along Sar'theris Strand until a Sar'theris Striker comes up.
  collect 16968 quest 6607.3

step Feralas Ahi
  zone Feralas
  tip Fish the Verdantis River until a Feralas Ahi comes up. Feralas water is hard below 300: put a lure on the pole.
  collect 16967 quest 6607.1

step Clamlette Surprise
  zone Tanaris
  tip The rocs of Tanaris drop Giant Eggs; the arrow picks the nearest. Then hand everything to Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan for Artisan Cooking, and buy Spotted Yellowtail from Gikkix on the coast while you are in Tanaris.
  collect 12207 x12 nearest
  turnin 6611
  accept 6610
  turnin 6610
  learn 18238 nearest

step Savage Coast Blue Sailfin
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Take the boat from Ratchet to Booty Bay and fish the Savage Coast, the west shore of Stranglethorn, until a Savage Coast Blue Sailfin comes up. Buy Filet of Redgill from Kelsey Yance in Booty Bay: Redgill is the best fish for the last stretch to 300.
  collect 16969 quest 6607.4
  learn 18241 nearest

step Misty Reed Mahi Mahi
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Fish the Misty Reed Strand, the east shore of the Swamp of Sorrows, until a Misty Reed Mahi Mahi comes up.
  collect 16970 quest 6607.2

step Back to Nat Pagle
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Hand Nat his four fish for Artisan Fishing.
  turnin 6607

